          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>This story presents key insights about customer distribution, customer value, and claim behavior.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>The goal is to understand regional behavior, explore relationships between key variables, and compare claim amounts across vehicle categories. </run>
